//RS //! Foreign package export and publication.
//RS //!
//RS //! The .jetlib file is the authority for this surface. It carries the
//RS //! checked export table, ABI identity, target, and native payload digest.
//RS //! This module projects that table into host package formats. It does not
//RS //! parse Jet source or infer types from generated code.
//RS 
